# Generated files that are one long line or binary (review R2-025): git grep prints "Binary file matches" for them, git diff and
# PR views skip their contents, and GitHub folds them as generated. "binary" also stops line-ending changes on Windows.
# Base64 page copies of models and KTX2 light maps (written by the builders, the bake and the packing steps, never by hand)
apps/**/models/*.txt          binary linguist-generated
stickers/renderer/models/*.txt binary linguist-generated
# Retired asset variants, kept as they were
props/**/archive/*.txt        binary linguist-generated
# The clearing's layout from the live page (props/shadow/export_casters.cjs): text, but one 100 KB line
props/shadow/layout_picked.json -diff linguist-generated
# Models and textures
*.glb                         binary linguist-generated
*.ktx2                        binary linguist-generated
# The npm lock file: kept, but not shown line by line
package-lock.json             -diff linguist-generated
# The review's findings.md: written by docs/reviews/code-review-2026-11-13/build.py from findings.json and status.json, never by
# hand (review R2-108). Still readable on GitHub; its diff is hidden, so a status change shows in status.json only.
docs/reviews/*/findings.md     -diff linguist-generated
